            "text": "<h2>Hand Delivery</h2><p>Delivering cakes and cupcakes is a delicate business, so we use a small team of drivers to get your Freshly Baked Happiness from us to you! Our super-friendly drivers are trained to handle your precious baked goods carefully and will check your order before they ring your bell.<br/></p>",
