    "rich_text_LKk8W9": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_nbFG8q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Please ensure someone is available at your chosen delivery address on the day you’ve selected. If you’re sending Flavourtown as a gift, it’s best to advise the recipient that something delicious is coming their way that day.<br/><br/>If there’s nobody around to accept your delivery, we will do our absolute best to contact you, if this isn’t possible, we will attempt to leave your order with a neighbour/receptionist/post room OR in a safe place of your choice. Unfortunately, we cannot take your order away again for re-delivery, and it will be left at the delivery address.<br/><br/>We’re always thrilled to deliver to offices and businesses, but kindly note that we can’t accept liability for any issues such as damage after your order is signed for and left with a post room/reception. It’s always best to alert post rooms, etc., that you’re expecting a fragile delivery.</p><p><strong>IF YOU REQUIRE A PRECISE DELIVERY TIME, PLEASE </strong><a href=\"https://www.flavourtownbakery.co.uk/pages/contact-flavourtown\" title=\"Contact Flavourtown\"><strong>CONTACT US</strong></a><strong>, AND WE CAN ADVISE ON COSTS AND LOGISTICS FROM ONE OF OUR TRUSTED EXTERNAL DELIVERY PARTNERS.</strong></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "button_Q7Phix": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_1_label": "Get in touch",
