      "blocks": {
        "text_pN3V6W": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Nationwide Delivery</h2><p>Flavourtown UK cookie and brownie deliveries ship on a NEXT DAY delivery service with DPD. You will receive a notification of dispatch of your order.<br/><br/>Please note it is the customers responsibility to ensure someone will be at home to receive the delivery and/or to have offered \"safe place\" information to DPD. In the event of non-delivery DPD will attempt to redeliver the following day but because of the freshly baked handmade nature of the products we cannot attempt further deliveries.<br/><br/>It is the customers responsibility to ensure a complete FULL address and postcode is supplied along with a correct phone number. Flavourtown Bakery LTD can’t accept any responsibility for orders supplied with incorrect or incomplete information.<br/><br/>You will receive a DPD notification on the day of delivery with a timeslot. DPD deliveries are fully trackable and will offer you ‘safe place’ and ‘on-the-day’ options.<br/><br/>Once your order has been quality checked and dispatched from our bakery, we can’t accept any responsibility for delays occurred by the DPD service. We will attempt to resolve issues on your behalf IF possible. DPD delays are RARE*, and you will be notified of any issued by DPD on the day.<br/><br/>The products will be at your risk from the time you accept delivery of them from DPD.<br/><br/>*Please note that although we use a DPD next day service, there are times of the year (such as Christmas) when delays may be more likely.<br/><br/></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
